Danqing (丹青) — Third-Party Palette Data, Artwork, Font, and Software Notices
===============================================================================

Danqing is distributed without any GPL or AGPL runtime or build-time code dependencies.
We gratefully acknowledge the following researchers, museums, scientific consortia, and
open-source projects whose published color values, public-domain museum photographs, and
permissive libraries power Danqing's 3,406-palette library:

